(7605949, 1229598, 173844, '<td valign="top">Personal co-favorite and one of your nines.  A glowing, tattered, wondrous symphony of doors, windows and sundry rectangles that pulsates with life.  The colors are an expedition into honey and amber.  Like one of those games in which various pieces are shifted around within a contained square into a coherent solution, but this''ll never be solved.</td>', 'Personal co-favorite and one of your nines.  A glowing, tattered, wondrous symphony of doors, windows and sundry rectangles that pulsates with life.  The colors are an expedition into honey and amber.  Like one of those games in which various pieces are shifted around within a contained square into a coherent solution, but this''ll never be solved.', '2018-12-21 10:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7605953, 1229769, 109363, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> From Bohemian Locksmithery :P<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/1200/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1229014.png'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/1200/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1229014.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/1200/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1229014.png"/> <br/>Open it!<br/>I will not open it.<br/>Open it!<br/>I will not open it.<br/>I''m just a lock box. Nobody knows me.<br/>He''s just a lock box. Nobody has the key.<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/1200/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1229014.png'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/1200/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1229014.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/1200/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1229014.png"/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>love it.  thanks for the theme song!</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: From Bohemian Locksmithery :P Open it!I will not open it.Open it!I will not open it.I''m just a lock box. Nobody knows me.He''s just a lock box. Nobody has the key.   love it.  thanks for the theme song!', '2018-12-21 11:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7605955, 1229701, 173844, '<td valign="top">So <u>very</u> closed.  Rusted closed to the extent that time itself seems forbidden, but how beautifully.  A solid composition that thrills in the details therein.  The colors, in hue and contrast, are lovely.  I especially love the blues, how they spill from the barrier into the sky, or vice versa.</td>', 'So very closed.  Rusted closed to the extent that time itself seems forbidden, but how beautifully.  A solid composition that thrills in the details therein.  The colors, in hue and contrast, are lovely.  I especially love the blues, how they spill from the barrier into the sky, or vice versa.', '2018-12-21 12:30:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7605958, 1229779, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome in so many ways.  The rectilinear composition is adroitly broken, as by the ice cream cone and the intriguing reflected scene in the window.  The "Closed" signs are subtly echoed by the empty parking spaces.  And yet there''s a niggling dissonance, as the saturated blue of the building implies freshly painted and welcome to the new season.  Time, here, is being playfully juggled.  The overall processing is compelling.  It adds to the sense of nostalgia, of summers past.  An abiding quiet that lingers and fulfills.   <br/>Gave a seven. Sorry, should be a nine or ten.</td>', 'Handsome in so many ways.  The rectilinear composition is adroitly broken, as by the ice cream cone and the intriguing reflected scene in the window.  The "Closed" signs are subtly echoed by the empty parking spaces.  And yet there''s a niggling dissonance, as the saturated blue of the building implies freshly painted and welcome to the new season.  Time, here, is being playfully juggled.  The overall processing is compelling.  It adds to the sense of nostalgia, of summers past.  An abiding quiet that lingers and fulfills.   Gave a seven. Sorry, should be a nine or ten.', '2018-12-21 12:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7605960, 1229749, 173844, '<td valign="top">A personal co-favorite.  One of your nines.  Beautifully meets the challenge.  The foreshortening closes off the turning road and brings the mountains up close and daunting.  The painterly effect works very well here because color takes precedence over detail, though not to say the details as they are aren''t important and compelling.  A strong, dramatic, lovely image.<br/>I''m shocked that this photo has been so roundly unappreciated.  Perhaps the processing has put many people off.  Never mind, great stuff.</td>', 'A personal co-favorite.  One of your nines.  Beautifully meets the challenge.  The foreshortening closes off the turning road and brings the mountains up close and daunting.  The painterly effect works very well here because color takes precedence over detail, though not to say the details as they are aren''t important and compelling.  A strong, dramatic, lovely image.I''m shocked that this photo has been so roundly unappreciated.  Perhaps the processing has put many people off.  Never mind, great stuff.', '2018-12-21 13:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7605962, 1229653, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Elena. A beautiful image which fits perfectly. I love that lensbaby focus!</td>', 'Congratulations Elena. A beautiful image which fits perfectly. I love that lensbaby focus!', '2018-12-21 15:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7605966, 1229653, 109387, '<td valign="top">You already know that I''m a fan of your images, but I have to say that this is one of your best shots. I really love it! Congrats on your win!</td>', 'You already know that I''m a fan of your images, but I have to say that this is one of your best shots. I really love it! Congrats on your win!', '2018-12-21 17:29:49.000000', NULL, 0),
